| `installUrl` | https://cloud.google.com/sdk/docs/install-sdk |
| `macosInstallPath` | `~/google-cloud-sdk/bin/bq` |
| `linuxInstallPath` | `~/google-cloud-sdk/bin/bq` |
| `windowsInstallPath` | `%LOCALAPPDATA%\Google\CloudSDK\google-cloud-sdk\bin\bq.cmd` |
| `macosMethods` | `gcloud-sdk-bundled` |
| `linuxMethods` | `gcloud-sdk-bundled` |
| `windowsMethods` | `gcloud-sdk-bundled` |

Dry-runs:

1. `bq version` — exit 0.
2. `bq help` — exit 0.

`gcloud-sdk-bundled` means install or repair the shared SDK using the `gcloud`
row; it is not a separate package-manager choice.

### `vsplotter`

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| `id` | `vsplotter` |
| `kind` | `sedea-extension` |
| `extensionId` | `RafaelArvelo.vsplotter` |
| `minVersion` | `presence-only` |
| `docsUrl` | https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=RafaelArvelo.vsplotter |
| `installUrl` | https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/configure/extensions/extension-marketplace#_command-line-extension-management |
| `macosMethods` | `sedea-cli-install-extension` |
| `linuxMethods` | `sedea-cli-install-extension` |
| `windowsMethods` | `sedea-cli-install-extension` |

Probe and dry-run:

```text
"<sedea-cli>" --list-extensions --show-versions
```

Match `RafaelArvelo.vsplotter` case-insensitively. The extension is currently
listed on Microsoft Visual Studio Marketplace and may not exist in Sedea's
configured Open VSX gallery. The install mission must first try the Sedea CLI
against the configured gallery. If unavailable, stop and offer a trusted local
VSIX path or skip; never silently install it into another editor or download an
unverified VSIX.

## Sedea CLI resolution

| OS | Resolution |
|----|------------|
| macOS | `/Applications/Sedea.app/Contents/Resources/app/bin/code` |
| Linux | `sedea` on PATH, or user-supplied Sedea CLI |
| Windows | `sedea` on PATH, or user-supplied Sedea CLI |

Install after consent:

```text
"<sedea-cli>" --install-extension "RafaelArvelo.vsplotter" --force
```

